{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026h0z2VhkMvv1795596821.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《審計報告》發現，在職家庭及學生資助處未有盡職審查申請人資格，更在覆查後，才發現三年間多批3,500萬元貸款。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208351-%E5%AF%A9%E8%A8%88%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E8%81%B7%E5%AD%B8%E8%99%95%E6%9C%AA%E7%9B%A1%E8%81%B7%E5%AF%A9%E6%9F%A5%E7%94%B3%E8%AB%8B%E4%BA%BA%E8%B3%87%E6%A0%BC%E8%A6%86%E6%9F%A5%E5%BE%8C%E6%89%8D%E7%99%BC%E7%8F%BE%E5%A4%9A%E6%89%B9%E8%B2%B8%E6%AC%BE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>審計報告｜職學處未盡職審查申請人資格　覆查後才發現多批貸款</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>《審計報告》又指，地政總署處理土地契約修訂時，出現長年積壓及延誤，最長一宗個案要近30年。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208360-%E5%AF%A9%E8%A8%88%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%9C%B0%E6%94%BF%E7%B8%BD%E7%BD%B2%E8%99%95%E7%90%86%E5%9C%9F%E5%9C%B0%E5%A5%91%E7%B4%84%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E7%8F%BE%E9%95%B7%E5%B9%B4%E7%A9%8D%E5%A3%93%E5%8F%8A%E5%BB%B6%E8%AA%A4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>審計報告｜地政總署處理土地契約修訂現長年積壓及延誤</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案完成證人作供，周五將開始結案陳詞。鄺港智回應代表大律師安華暉覆問時重申，他想成為控方證人，但警方「騙了自己口供」，用有關供詞起訴他。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208361-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E9%87%8D%E7%94%B3%E5%86%80%E6%88%90%E6%8E%A7%E6%96%B9%E8%AD%89%E4%BA%BA%E6%83%9F%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E9%A8%99%E4%BA%86%E5%8F%A3%E4%BE%9B%E5%91%A8%E4%BA%94%E7%B5%90%E6%A1%88%E9%99%B3%E8%A9%9E\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜鄺港智重申冀成控方證人惟警方「騙了口供」　周五結案陳詞</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>醫務衞生局宣布，社區藥物名冊12月30日推出。名冊在原有基本藥物上新增38項藥物，覆蓋範圍擴至泌尿科、眼科、皮膚科等。藥物價格較市價折讓最多九成。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208359-%E7%A4%BE%E5%8D%80%E8%97%A5%E7%89%A9%E5%90%8D%E5%86%8A12%E6%9C%8830%E6%97%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E38%E9%A0%85%E8%97%A5%E7%89%A9%E6%B6%B5%E8%93%8B%E6%B3%8C%E5%B0%BF%E7%A7%91%E5%8F%8A%E7%9C%BC%E7%A7%91%E7%AD%89\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>社區藥物名冊12月30日推出　新增38項藥物涵蓋泌尿科及眼科等</strong></a><strong> </strong></p><p></p><p>海關瓦解一個大型私煙及洗黑錢集團，檢獲約3,200萬支懷疑走私香煙，約值1.4億元，拘捕五人。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208340-%E6%B5%B7%E9%97%9C%E7%93%A6%E8%A7%A3%E5%A4%A7%E5%9E%8B%E7%A7%81%E7%85%99%E5%8F%8A%E6%B4%97%E9%BB%91%E9%8C%A2%E9%9B%86%E5%9C%98%E6%8B%98%E4%BA%94%E4%BA%BA%E6%AA%A2%E7%8D%B2%E7%B4%843200%E8%90%AC%E6%94%AF%E6%87%B7%E7%96%91%E7%A7%81%E7%85%99\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>海關瓦解大型私煙及洗黑錢集團拘五人　檢獲約3200萬支懷疑私煙</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.632852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":476,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:50:07.963590+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:37:18.609510+00:00","content_hash":"5dd700e01f5cbe8fdb843383345fe2671aadb85195ee21458ba5c4030ab7962e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:43:56.632852+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}